{{define "body"}}<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">Reset your password</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px">Someone asked to reset the password of the Proreta account <strong>{{.Params.email}}</strong>. To choose a new password, open this link:</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px"><a href="{{.Link}}" style="color:#1a1a1a;font-weight:600">Choose a new password</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:13px;color:#6b6b63;word-break:break-all">If the link does not open, copy this address into your browser:<br>{{.Link}}</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px">The link works once and expires in {{.Params.expires}}. Opening it takes you to a page where you set the new password; nothing changes before that. After the change every session of the account is signed out.</p>
<p style="margin:0">If you did not ask for this, ignore this message: your password stays as it is. Nobody can change it without this link.</p>{{end}}
{{define "footer"}}Sent by {{.PublicHost}}.{{end}}
